<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S1.SS3" title="In S1 Dataset ‣ An Exploratory Study on Abstract Imagesand Visual RepresentationsLearned from Them" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">S1.3 </span>Primitive <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">vs.</span> VTracer</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
